  This &property; applies gives a constant mass density to all points
  within the &material;.  It contributes an amount
  <varname>rho</varname> to the diagonal entries of
  <inlineequation><alt role="tex">\(M_{ij}\)</alt></inlineequation> in
  the <xref linkend="Equation-Force_Balance"/> &equation;,
  Eq.&nbsp;<xref linkend="Eqn-Force_Balance"/>.
